  "hero_summary_zh": "断绝敌人后路，分割敌人实力，抑或是震撼众敌脚下的大地，撼地者最擅长出其不意的袭击。就算侥幸挺过了余震，一记强大的图腾还在后面等着。",
  "hero_summary_en": "Whether blocking an enemy's escape, dividing their forces, or shattering the ground beneath gathered foes, Earthshaker is at his best when he strikes without warning. Whatever survives the aftershocks still has a swing from his mighty totem to look forward to.",
